<%- include('partials/header') %>

<style>
  body {
    background: linear-gradient(125deg, #050403 0%, #100A07 38%, #28140C 72%, #422315 100%) !important;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .main-content-gradient {
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    padding: clamp(170px, 15vw, 210px) 0 5rem !important;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .main-content-gradient {
      padding: clamp(155px, 20vw, 185px) 0 3.5rem !important;
    }
  }
  .stat-counter-card {
    background: transparent !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4) !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-num-value {
    color: #CBA135 !important;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(203, 161, 53, 0.4) !important;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .stat-label-text span {
    color: #F4EDE0 !important;
  }
  .page-hero-banner {
    display: none !important;
  }
</style>

<section class="main-content-gradient">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px;">
    
    <style>
      .history-card {
        background: var(--bg-dark);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
      }
      .history-title {
        font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
        color: var(--temple-maroon);
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        border-left: 4px solid var(--royal-gold);
        padding-left: clamp(0.5rem, 2vw, 1rem);
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .history-title {
          font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 4.5vw, 1.2rem);
        }
      }
    </style>
    <div class="history-card">
      <h1 class="history-title" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--royal-gold), #fff); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">
        <span class="lang-mr">मंडळाचा गौरवशाली इतिहास</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Glorious History of the Mandal</span>
      </h1>
      <!-- Paragraph 1 -->
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.2vw, 1.05rem); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; text-align: justify; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(203, 161, 53, 0.08);">
        <span class="lang-mr">मुंबईतील भायखळा येथील दगडी चाळ सार्वजनिक नवरात्रौत्सव मंडळाची स्थापना १९७३ साली झाली. तेव्हापासून आई माऊलीच्या नवरात्रोत्सवाची परंपरा सुरू आहे. श्रद्धा आणि भक्तीचे प्रतीक असलेल्या आई माऊलीच्या दर्शनासाठी दरवर्षी नवरात्रोत्सवाच्या काळात अनेक भाविक उपस्थित राहतात. हा उत्सव देवीच्या आराधनेचा आणि नवरात्रीच्या पवित्र परंपरेचा एक महत्त्वाचा भाग आहे.</span>
        <span class="lang-en">The Dagdi Chawl Sarvajanik Navratri Utsav Mandal, located in Byculla, Mumbai, was established in 1973. Since then, the tradition of celebrating Navratri in honour of Aai Mauli has continued.

A symbol of faith and devotion, Aai Mauli draws numerous devotees every year during the Navratri festival, as they gather to seek Her divine blessings. This celebration holds a special place in the worship of the Goddess and represents the sacred traditions and spiritual significance of Navratri.</span>
      </p>

      <!-- Paragraph 2 -->
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.2vw, 1.05rem); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: justify; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(203, 161, 53, 0.08);">
        <span class="lang-mr">दरवर्षी नवरात्रोत्सवानिमित्त मंडळातर्फे देवीची भव्य मूर्ती, आकर्षक सजावट आणि विद्युत रोषणाईने उत्सव साजरा केला जातो. पारंपरिक धार्मिक विधी आणि भक्तिमय वातावरणामुळे या उत्सवाला विशेष महत्त्व प्राप्त झाले आहे. १९७३ पासून सुरू असलेली आई माऊलीच्या नवरात्रोत्सवाची परंपरा आजही भक्तिभावाने जपली जात आहे.<br><br><strong style="color: var(--royal-gold); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(203,161,53,0.5);">जय शंभो नारायण!</strong><br><strong style="color: var(--royal-gold); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(203,161,53,0.5);">दगडी चाळीच्या आई माउलीचा विजय असो!</strong></span>
        <span class="lang-en">Every year, the Navratri festival is celebrated by the Mandal with a magnificent idol of the Goddess, captivating decorations, and dazzling illumination. The traditional religious rituals and deeply devotional atmosphere make this celebration truly special. The sacred tradition of celebrating Navratri in honour of Aai Mauli, which began in 1973, continues to be cherished and upheld with unwavering faith and devotion to this day.<br><br><strong style="color: var(--royal-gold); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(203,161,53,0.5);">Jai Shambho Narayan!</strong><br><strong style="color: var(--royal-gold); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(203,161,53,0.5);">Victory to Aai Mauli of Dagdi Chawl!</strong></span>
      </p>
    </div>


    <!-- Animated Stat Counter Row -->
    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; gap: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="stat-counter-card">
        <div class="stat-num-value" data-target="1973" data-no-comma="true">1973</div>
        <div class="stat-label-text">
          <span class="lang-mr">स्थापना वर्ष</span><span class="lang-en">Founding Year</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-counter-card">
        <div class="stat-num-value" data-target="53">53</div>
        <div class="stat-label-text">
          <span class="lang-mr">अविरत सेवेची वर्षे</span><span class="lang-en">Years of Continuous Service</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>



  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
